# ==============================================================================
# Pattern A: Sentinel Isolation & Privacy Boundaries
# ==============================================================================
# Why: Allows creating arbitrary future scratchpads, unannounced drafts, or internal
# assets without editing .gitignore or risking accidental commits to public history.

# 1. Any file or directory starting with an underscore (e.g., _drafts/, _scratch/, _priv/, _notes.txt)
_*/
_*

# 2. Dedicated private directories
private/
priv/
.gg_utils/
.agents/


# ==============================================================================
# Secrets & Environment Configurations
# ==============================================================================
# Why: Protects local runtime secrets, authentication tokens, and credentials.
*.env
*.env.*
*.local
*.secret
*.secret.*
*.key
*.pem
.geminiignore
GEMINI.md
credentials.*


# ==============================================================================
# Operating System & Editor Artifacts
# ==============================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# ==============================================================================
# Python & Build Cache Artifacts
# ==============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
